If you would like to disable this feature, add the following to your .vimrc:\n        `set t_fd=`\n        `set t_fe=`\n```","ts":"1615080610.290000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"66745ea1-da52-40ce-916c-ffb32a81345a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"汎用かはともかく、ちょっと別口で機能が追加されたようです。\n:h xterm-focus-event","ts":"1615080609.289900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iSgZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47c2824e-11bc-45ec-b234-94d75898f323","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"fcitx-skk試したときibus-skkよりなんとなく遅い気がしたんですが、意外と他の人は快適に使えてる感じなんですかね","ts":"1615066180.288600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JPV"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"\u003c@U01PQE8LNE9\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1615065893.288300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"1184b02c-4412-4bd2-afbf-98461ebbff03","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"飲酒時に sudo を止めるコマンドらしい。便利。","ts":"1615047189.287600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"daiji","count":6,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U06ECBRTJ","U01ATUT6PL3","U01BY3SDBRS","U9S4G0LJW","U01HXNSLCH5"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kanF+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c68d5f8b-e0de-4052-9fce-7db5baf2bb04","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/solt9029/status/1368060841115840513\u003e","ts":"1615047178.287200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/solt9029|@solt9029\u003e: 飲酒sudoを防止するシステムを作りました \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1368060552640008196/pu/img/tzQ0AgcpkPo9BTmw.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"食塩出現","author_subname":"@solt9029","author_lin